<li about="#cite_note-DELAMARRE-7" id="cite_note-DELAMARRE-7" data-mw-footnote-number="7"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCL8"><a href="#cite_ref-DELAMARRE_7-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCMA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCME">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-DELAMARRE-7" class="mw-reference-text reference-text">
Xavier Delamarre, <i id="mwCMI">Dictionnaire de la langue gauloise</i>, errance 2003. <abbr class="abbr" title="page" id="mwCMM">p.</abbr><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwCMQ"> </span>64.</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-8" id="cite_note-8" data-mw-footnote-number="8"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCMU"><a href="#cite_ref-8" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCMY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCMc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-8" class="mw-reference-text reference-text">Cette racine indo-européenne a aussi donné le gaulois <i id="mwCMg">*bāgos</i>, attesté dans la <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toponymie" title="Toponymie" id="mwCMk">toponymie</a> gauloise<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwCMo"> </span>: <i id="mwCMs">Bavay</i> dans le Nord, ancien <i id="mwCMw">Bagacum</i>, <i id="mwCM0">Beynes</i> dans les Yvelines, d'un gaulois <i id="mwCM4">*bāginā</i> «<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwCM8"> </span>hêtraie<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwCNA"> </span>»<sup about="#mwt51" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-DELAMARRE_7-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"DELAMARRE"}}'><a href="#cite_note-DELAMARRE-7" id="mwCNE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCNI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCNM">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCNQ">]</span></span></a></sup></span></li>
